{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/8754076068ca954d6967d700c866ed51.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match X's and O's in classic style on ever-increasing board sizes. force stalemates to level up and increase score multipliers, increasing the challenge while you try not to lose. This simple tic-tac-toe inspired game is surprisingly strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Easy to Get In Too Deep</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early moves are key to higher scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put off winning to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate game modes to mix up your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/856c7e09d6b1bd5ecf8916109b37e67c.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703460?t=1752234668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/1b2512ac1477c80d1f7dcea112df6e4ff3af207e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752234668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/44de957392b8168cb2de4e4032d734d9c356fbc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752234668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/44de957392b8168cb2de4e4032d734d9c356fbc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752234668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"descr